Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did not have the figurine on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says he already sold it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To a man named Kijima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what he told me.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(627.4,971.2)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.26,0:02:01.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(450,620.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}The Worth of a Maid's Fist and Pancreas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um ronko would um one of these help i
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thought your hair might be in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh you can take whichever\None you like i shall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,borrow this one uh no\Nplease you can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to Oinky Doink Cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come visit our cafe, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I would say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way, lowlifes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, a maid just\Ntried to give me a flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she doesn't try to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, precious Gracie Poo, what an unruly\Ntown this is Nerula, who are those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're from an anime figurine company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:03:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that they're known for\Nbuying and selling premium figurines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me the fake, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An amateur would never be\Nable to tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll sell that one for a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet little Gracie Poo,\Ndon't you worry at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone touch\Na single hair on your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head it's best if we\Nstay far away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanting a Gospodin tick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time come to oinky-doink cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think i'm threatened\Nby some trashy maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could take over your\Ncheesy cafe just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some trashy what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should a maid be initiating violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I am a maid,\Nyou wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't simply back down after\Nbeing insulted like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maids should be cute by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a maid, you foreigner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did tyra send you here to collect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, i am here to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To escort you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to acknowledge\Nyou as a true maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all look awfully vivacious\Nfor a bunch of hogs that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,haven't paid back any of the\Nhoney money that you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,given how much trouble you've caused\Nyou can't possibly complain no
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter what kind of job we ask you\Nto do now let's get down to business
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey how much water do you expect\Nme to drink i can't have all that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sloshing around in my gut you\Nbetter stand back i'm gonna spew the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shit out all over you but hold on\Nnow that's quite an impressive body
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got there manager yes whatever\Nyou say i have something in mind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:05:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would be perfect for your\Nwater pouring porker let's negotiate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terms i bet it's another high-risk\Njob no need to worry about a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't call myself manager\Nif i can't protect my piglets
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one last thing the eggs\Nleft in the fridge they're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,past their expiration\Nbut they're still good
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, where's Ronko?\NChief, she went straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the venue we'd better\Nhead over there too
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll cross monsea bridge in the opposite\Ndirection towards the successful tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you made her take the job after all huh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but earlier you said a\Nmanager's supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protect her staff the\Nwind's blowing our way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ronko's on board too great\Nso where are we going
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Akiba Fluffy and Sweet Club.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.79,0:05:57.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs50}The Akiba Fluffy Light n' Sweet Club
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww, how cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the job a live gig or something? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one that pumps you\Nchock full of adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, throw her a hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much I bet on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.36,0:06:19.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs80}The Akiba Fluffy Light n' Sweet Club
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Akiba Fluffy and Sweet Club?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.98,0:06:20.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs80\alpha&HFF&}The Akiba {\alpha&H00&}F{\alpha&HFF&}luffy {\alpha&H00&}Light n' Sweet Club
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs80\alpha&HFF&}The Akiba {\alpha&H00&}F{\alpha&HFF&}luffy L{\alpha&H00&}ight {\alpha&HFF&}n' Sweet {\alpha&H00&}Club
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, take your places.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're going to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall do my best. What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid shouldn't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding for the sake of her\Ncafe is what a maid does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.10,0:06:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco will lose in the\Nthird round by knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without fail, exactly as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashtray.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.13,0:06:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I practice a special breathing technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want an eye\Npatch on your other eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd better deliver on\Nyour end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Taira, Kijima is here\Nto show you a new figurine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're rigging it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, that's so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So does that mean we're just going\Nto lose and get paid for the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the outcome as well, so we'll\Nbet on the opponent and rake it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, our chiefs are real genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a new face is up against the champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That intimidating presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This made Ronko look promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pure monkey Masami's\Nthe uncontested reigning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,champion despite having those\Nbeautiful delicate arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in peak condition to win her\Nthird consecutive championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be one hell of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crush your pretty\Nlittle baseball ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uncontested champion? That girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say you're extremely\Nfortunate, Miss Tyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This item has never been\Ndisplayed on the open market!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We barely managed to\Nacquire this one ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Gracie-poo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Grace Inumata.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A character from the anime\NLegendary Fighter Nobuaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's one of my favorites, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though still in grade school,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's an exceptional mentor who\Nsupports Nobuaki's development.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her steadfast devotion inspired me\Nso much growing up as a young child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as you might know, she's as\Nminor as a sub-character can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were very few\Nfigurines made to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that scarcity escalated\Nher price tremendously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's easily going to fetch\Nway beyond 10 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay any price you want for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only because of my\Nloyal admiration for her that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to train our\Nstarfighter to be a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why on earth did you win the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just barely. In the first round?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a single punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you a hundred times\Nto lose in the third round!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've been in the ring, I realize\NI have difficulty pulling punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's contrary to how I've lived my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unusual was the opponent unaware of\Nthe deal you made earlier with her manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be tough creating a star in\Na world where strength is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, let us\Ndiscuss the price for gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sepul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This would have happened either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now bring those damn pigs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking if you have the ability to\Ncomprehend what the hell you've done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a dream! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to move to Hawaii and buy a tiki\Nbar and be surrounded by pretty boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, give us another chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get Ronco to beat everyone\Nand make it to the finals!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll totally wipe out the competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why should I want that pig to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the crowd is dead, sure, Ronko's\Ngoing to win it all and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll get her ass whooped\Nin the final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the moment your fighter\Nwill become a shining star.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us help you create a new sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can rig the match, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to rig it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just lose the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See how committed Ronko is to our plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a sorry excuse for a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't even smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she has fighting skills\Nfrom her military experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dirty swan of yours can't win\Neven if she messes with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a maid too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply dressed like I was a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither you nor I are\Nreal maids. Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you put a uniform on, you\Nhave the right to be a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:11:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only judge that determines if\Nyou're a maid or not, is yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, I'll go along with that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, Mistress Pig,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take this body here and shove it in the\Ntrunk of the car in the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, why are you sitting\Nthere naked? I'm devoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my screw-up that\Nbrought us here, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll cross Monsei Bridge in the opposite\Ndirection, towards a successful tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scheming again, aren't you, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first step toward tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(173,356)\fnPapyrus\fs50}ORGANS    Fizzle Fizzle Plop
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These places loan you\Nmoney and they'll let
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.53,0:12:00.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996.4,483.4)\fnPapyrus\fs50}I Want to Borrow Your Pancreas
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you use your organs as collateral organs.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.49,0:12:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1475.2,311.2)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Entrail Chargers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to win Anyway, you only need\Nlike half a stomach to survive for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's like borrowing money for free Hey,\Nlook, they have a stomach and lung combo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing I'm witnessing a living\Nlegend in the making right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the birth of a new star.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has to really fight her\Nto rig the match you might as
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well cheer her on Ronco's having\Nto break her neck in there
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.93,0:12:27.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,821)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}QUARTERFINALS
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(826,832)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}SEMIFINALS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, ho-hoo, an asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Tyra, have you seen our president?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared after you asked to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he never showed\Nup for our appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we did find this\Non our security camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that same bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we take her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would interrupt the\Ntournament that's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us handle this matter for you. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to satisfy your\Nthirst for vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the final bout, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dead maid tells no tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today you will die with the blame for\Nthis missing figurine on your shoulders,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've told Zoya to pummel\Nher to death, is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Ronko Manon is requesting\Nan audience with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She says she has something to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell her to go prepare for the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only judge that determines if you're\Na maid or not can only be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we give the signal, take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, only a monkey makes\Nthe same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the punches that come\Nyour way, and don't hit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Nyou're going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to take a dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't forget, tell me, which round?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 12th round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go out there and\Ntake one for the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final match between\Ntwo monster rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An MMA fight with 12 rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds are stacked\Nin Ronco Manon's favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I doubt it'll play out that smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough organs to\Nbet all the money I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lose the fight for the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see her punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she has to keep taking\Nall those hard blows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.06,0:14:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.44,0:14:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice! Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see tomorrow dawning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep this up till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way she can\Ndo this for 11 rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the go-ahead, so do it. Хорошо.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Back of the head? Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.56,0:15:23.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1363,702)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}MMA 101
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a nut shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, that's not a nut shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Hey, referee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you about to hit her? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like she was coming in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see pretty boys in my future!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize she's about to be\Nkilled for some useless petty cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:15:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be taking any more hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winds of Waikiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you better than worn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an oinky-doink maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said cafe is full of\Nnothing but wannabe maids. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who acknowledges you as a maid\Nmust be total crap, just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid bitch. Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a monkey makes the same\Nmistake twice, you stupid bi -
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your paw off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hair tie is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a spare one\Nin your paw, Tronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have a spare one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you ready to fight me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you can't spin\Non our cafe's good name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And think that you'll get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I am a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this wasn't the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:17:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those damn rotten pig heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! My pancreas!\NMy pancreas! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please lose, Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did her deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would she really be called a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was always denied cute\Nthings from an early age.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was when I discovered\Nthe world of maid
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cafes and aspired to become a maid myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the maids I envisioned in my\Nmind didn't reek of blood like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To me, they were all\Nbrightness and sparkles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And shining with so much\Ncuteness it was blinding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.46,0:18:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look great! Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.36,0:18:56.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1336,384.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Trial Shift
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, can't you act cuter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not cut out to be a cute cafe maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know how to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm wearing this adorable\Nhair tie that Nagomi gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I've been against her, will\Nthat help me acknowledge myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If, like her, I can call myself cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are very cute, as are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheburoshka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Baan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My spleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pieces of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let those pigs out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found this note posted on\Nyour office door. Miss Tyra,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to tell\Nyou something about the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,body you had me dump in\Nthe trunk of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means our president was\Nhere before he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you must have killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two sold off your organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pancreas is just decorative,\Nlike window dressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, hey, listen, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't that creepy Kijima guy make a\Nfortune off of selling premium figurines?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, maybe we can sell this.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.30,0:21:18.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(440,515.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't even manage to pay\Noff any of our overdue dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you should be grateful\Nyou got to keep all of your organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellyaching won't get\Nus to tomorrow, piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, striking it rich\Nstarts one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters, I got some extra pig power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Zoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the new maid joining\NOinkie Doon starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my very best to\Nbecome a cute, adorable maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, from yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really the same person?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cute version is the real true meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An actual live overseas hire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tyra is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got her for free in the\Ndeal, no strings attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've finally gone international!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a total novice with no knowledge\Nto speak of, but I'll do my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm counting on you to teach me, Ranko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't
